:: Accept her assurance [Vylin-injured] {"position":"850,675","size":"100,100"}



:: Adventure start [Start] {"position":"200,100","size":"100,100"}

You were hired by a wizard to explore his tower in the woods. He got locked out and a rival wizard has taken up residence there. It's your job to explore the tower and confront the rival wizard. You are with a party you've adventured with many times before. Kin'eer the paladin, Alkin the warrior, Dusk the sorcerer, Dawn the ranger, Vylin the noble bard, and of course you! (Input name here):(input: bind $Player)
After traveling in the woods of the wizard, you find his tower. The base looks like a common cottage, but all of you know that the tower scales far above the tops of the trees, further than any of you can see.
- [[Reminisce on your party]]
-[[Proceed to door]]
-(Link-rerun: "Inventory")[
(alert: (joined: ", ", ...$Items))
]
